Right drawer: 400–440px, closed until an entity is selected. Below approximately 1280px, use an overlay drawer rather than compressing the table into unreadable columns.

In canvas views, show a collapsible bottom result tray with compact cards. Selecting a card selects the same entity on the canvas and in the drawer.

On mobile: filter sheet, list-first navigation, full-screen detail sheet. No three-column squeeze.

