14. Build order

Inspect repository, routes, components, database and existing scan/ranking behavior. Preserve instructions in AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md and avoid a framework rewrite.

Implement the shared shell, typography, toolbar, query/filter state, responsive drawer and useful company rows.

Complete one venture and one builder sourcing path for each of Penn and Berkeley using the companion source file. Enrich existing candidates.

Connect the real university geography and result tray. Implement or repair Globe without blocking usable Table access.

